
 Minutes of FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

Date: 04/11/91   Time: 22:28EDT

 Notice on door: "Minimalist" is being used as a synonym for "anti-
 progressive" in some  ForthNet traffic. Do you concur or disagree ?"
 This set the tone for much of the evening's discussion. Other items
 discussed include the upcoming MISC conference with Charles Johnsen,
 free access during the MISC conference, Ans MUMPS extensions.

